 # 6.8.0.0
+
+# Core
+
+## `LineItemQuantitySplitter::split()` requires a rounding config
+
+`Shopware\Core\Checkout\Cart\LineItem\LineItemQuantitySplitter::split()` gets the new required parameter `CashRoundingConfig $rounding`. Split line item taxes are rounded with this config. Calls without it trigger a deprecation warning in 6.7 and throw in 6.8. Pass `$context->getItemRounding()` as the fourth argument to keep the current behaviour. Classes that extend the splitter and override `split()` read the argument with `func_get_arg(3)` until 6.8.
 
