 ## Core
+
+### `LineItemQuantitySplitter::split()` accepts a rounding config
+
+`LineItemQuantitySplitter::split()` accepts a `CashRoundingConfig` as fourth argument. It becomes required with 6.8; calls without it trigger a deprecation warning. Extensions that call `split()` pass `$context->getItemRounding()` now. Extensions that only use the cart are not affected.
 
